  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 8.0% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.18B (8.0% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CRX Trade launches Swiss prime brokerage bridging crypto exchanges and Wall Street, as tokenized stock trading surges</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/08/securitize-brings-apple-nvidia-and-tesla-to-solana-with-nyse-trading-in-the-works\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize brings Apple, Nvidia and Tesla to Solana, with NYSE trading in the works</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxPX3ROUVVoUjJxZC15THd1c3ZnQk41dzRYODBrTXhZR1l6TFR2dGU2VzVYaDVubVp4OTE2d2RTYS1BTmx3SkJENDMxZVlpNThvUVl2T3M3ODBhSzdJM2o0TlhCS0gzSDdxZGFHMVRMQWRKYl9tbHk5elVjMk1PVkpISC1wNWZrX09VdnEzcEJwbWg2RER5M1BZVHZkUmpHSFU2MVNmWmUyemc4YzQ5VzdPRjNWYU5oQnFpVDgtc2lYZEl5dkpO?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Securitize (SECZ) launches tokenized U.S. stocks on Solana, plans NYSE and OKXICE trading</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-card-access-doesnt-match-global-demand-tangem-says?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Crypto card access doesn\u2019t match global demand, Tangem says</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
